器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">爆炎 · 多重制导导弹</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">锁定多目标发射导弹，蓄力较长，多发打中同一目标会少量衰减。蓄力一层：3发，二层：7发，三层：15发。导弹命中敌人时额外造成56点火焰元素伤害，并引发延迟爆炸，造成490点范围火焰元素伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">极限射击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:20][冷却:120秒]提高100%攻击速度，持续12.00秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给、家园补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">置换空间兑换（概率刷出）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗大伟哥黑金卡兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">第三期（V3.5）、第八期（V4.0）作战工坊限时兑换</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%